{"_id":"6a2fef142204ffbc59e5a304","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"KtV5Jl-hOcUS5L-15BUDD","description":"# Built-in Functions\n\nPython's built-in functions are available without any imports and cover common operations: `len()`, `sum()`, `min()`, `max()`, `sorted()`, `enumerate()`, `zip()`, `map()`, `filter()`, and others. These functions simplify common tasks and are used constantly alongside data analysis libraries.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Built-in Functions","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb32"},{"type":"article","title":"Master Python Filter: Syntax, Examples, and Best Practices","url":"https://roadmap.sh/python/filter","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb33"},{"type":"video","title":"All 71 built-in Python functions","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Qu_KXc7xSI","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb34"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:24:52.088Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/KtV5Jl-hOcUS5L-15BUDD.md"}